cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use evalproof in research or a published evaluation, please cite it."
title: "evalproof: LLM evaluation as measurement"
abstract: >-
  Calibrates an LLM judge against a small gold-labelled sample, corrects its pass rate with
  adjusted classify-and-count and prediction-powered inference, compares runs on paired
  cases with the exact McNemar test and a paired bootstrap, and gates CI only on
  regressions that are both larger than a tolerance and statistically significant.
type: software
authors:
